{
  "title": { "zh": "让核重放" },
  "adds": ["replay", "saturate", "clausify"],
  "tray": "machine",
  "intro": [
    {
      "t": {
        "zh": "新元件「重放」把证书交给核：用到的子句要确实由已知拆出，每一步要由 auto 从它的两条来源证出。全部通过，子句所来自的目标就证完了。"
      }
    }
  ],
  "after": {
    "zh": "Isabelle 里，Sledgehammer 找到的证明也由 metis 交给核重放。"
  },
  "tasks": [
    {
      "id": "au-replay",
      "kind": "machine",
      "want": "proved",
      "inputs": [{ "name": "in", "label": { "zh": "目标" } }],
      "backtrack": true,
      "tests": [
        { "goal": "Coffee", "hyps": ["Alarm → Up", "Up → Coffee", "Alarm"] },
        { "goal": "OnTime", "hyps": ["Bus ∨ Bike", "Bus → OnTime", "Bike → OnTime"] },
        { "goal": "Mortal(h)", "hyps": ["∀x. Human(x) → Mortal(x)", "Human(h)"] },
        { "goal": "¬Rain", "hyps": ["Rain → Wet", "¬Wet"] }
      ],
      "brief": {
        "zh": "设计一个证明助手，证完每一个目标：证明助手找证书，核来重放。"
      },
      "hint": [{ "zh": "证书要先有人找出来，再交给核。" }],
      "solution": ["c0 = clausify(in)", "c1 = saturate(c0)", "c2 = replay(c1)", "out <- c2"],
      "naive": ["c0 = clausify(in)", "c1 = saturate(c0)", "out <- c1"]
    }
  ]
}
